# The DOT_COMMON_ATTR tag can be used to set the common attributes for edges,
# nodes and subgraphs in order to reduce the generated amount of dot file content.
# The default value is: fontname=Helvetica,fontsize=10.
# This tag requires that the tag HAVE_DOT is set to YES.

