# The DOT_EDGE_ATTR tag can be used to set the attributes for the dot tool's
# edges in order to reduce the generated amount of dot file content.
# The default value is: labelfontname=Helvetica,labelfontsize=10.
# This tag requires that the tag HAVE_DOT is set to YES.

